of cards 1–6 in the series. With magical animals, science, mystery, and adventure—the Zoey and Sassafras series has something for everyone! Each story features a new magical animal with a problem that must be solved using science. There isn’t a set formula for each book; Zoey sometimes needs to run experiments, while other times she needs to investigate a mystery, and yet other times she needs to do research. Zoey models how to keep a science journal through her handwritten entries in each story. Each story is complete with a glossary of the kid-friendly definitions for scientific terms used. The series highlights child-led inquiry science, and the topics covered align with both Common Core and Next Generation Science Standards.","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/6cf89344938084f1b92219093d02902dd188ec2aaf672f74a5a482d7c8844d80/JHmLo98oTRgOjamibbRZc1SJ16sxSwF-1HB5Ym7Wubw.mp3","seriesorder":6,"seriestitle":"The Zoey and Sassafras Collection","cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/J_PKCvB9aQ8fu10_6thIoHvDhGhiu9S0P4GfScrXQek"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":3836,"fileSize":62197890,"hasStreams":false},"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2022-12-16T10:47:54.786Z"}},"cardId":"teBbD","createdAt":"2022-04-26T09:46:39.770Z","updatedAt":"2026-03-05T11:56:36.353Z","clubAvailability":[]},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}